#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:2
msgid "Orchestration, Contracts, and Validation API"
msgstr "编排、Contract 与 Validation API"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:4
msgid "This page documents the canonical public types that describe a RELIC workflow, validate its interfaces, compile it into an execution plan, and execute that plan through the existing simulator. It also documents the variable-contract and unified-validation APIs used by the same architecture."
msgstr "本页记录用于描述 RELIC workflow、验证其接口、将其编译为 execution plan，并通过现有 simulator 执行该计划的 canonical public type。本页还记录同一架构使用的 variable contract 与 unified validation API。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:9
msgid "The signatures below use `...` for a field backed by a fresh `default_factory` container. Canonical owner paths identify the module that implements a type. Convenience imports identify the supported shorter import when one exists."
msgstr "以下签名使用 `...` 表示由新的 `default_factory` 容器支持的字段。Canonical owner path 标识实现该类型的模块。便捷 import 标识存在时所支持的较短 import。"

