#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:40
msgid "`schema_version` identifies the GraphIR schema understood by the loader and compiler."
msgstr "`schema_version` 标识 loader 与 compiler 所理解的 GraphIR schema。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:42
msgid "`nodes` maps each workflow-local node identifier to a `NodeSpec`."
msgstr "`nodes` 将每个 workflow-local node 标识符映射到一个 `NodeSpec`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:43
msgid "`links` contains explicit directed connections between node ports."
msgstr "`links` 包含 node port 之间的显式有向连接。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:44
msgid "`metadata` carries workflow-level information that is preserved in the compile report."
msgstr "`metadata` 携带保留在 compile report 中的 workflow 级信息。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:46
msgid "`assertion` contains structural assertion payloads evaluated by graph validation. DEC, IPHS, reaction-network, port, state-domain, and related Gate 0 checks enter the compiler through this field."
msgstr "`assertion` 包含由 graph validation 评估的 structural assertion payload。DEC、IPHS、reaction-network、port、state-domain 及相关 Gate 0 检查通过此字段进入 compiler。"

