msgstr "关键方法："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:57
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`from_dict()` accepts the serialized GraphIR form. If explicit links are absent, it infers links from input bindings of the form `{\"link\": [source_node, source_port]}`. `to_dict()` returns the corresponding plain mapping and omits `assertion` only when that mapping is empty."
msgstr "`from_dict()` 接受序列化的 GraphIR 形式。若缺少显式 link，它会从 `{\"link\": [source_node, source_port]}` 形式的 input binding 推断 link。`to_dict()` 返回对应的普通 mapping，并且仅在 `assertion` mapping 为空时省略该字段。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:62
#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:1233
msgid "Failure semantics:"
msgstr "失败语义："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:64
msgid "A non-mapping payload, nodes value, node payload, inputs value, metadata value, or assertion value raises `TypeError`."
msgstr "非 mapping 的 payload、nodes value、node payload、inputs value、metadata value 或 assertion value 会引发 `TypeError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:66
msgid "A non-list outputs or links value raises `TypeError`."
msgstr "非 list 的 outputs 或 links value 会引发 `TypeError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:67
msgid "A missing or empty `schema_version` raises `ValueError`."
msgstr "缺失或为空的 `schema_version` 会引发 `ValueError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:68
msgid "A node without `class_type` raises `ValueError`."
msgstr "缺少 `class_type` 的 node 会引发 `ValueError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:69
msgid "Parsing does not prove that referenced nodes and ports exist. Those checks belong to `validate_graph()`."
msgstr "解析并不能证明被引用的 node 与 port 存在；这些检查由 `validate_graph()` 负责。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:72
msgid "`NodeSpec`"
msgstr "`NodeSpec`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:74
msgid "Canonical owner: `relic.orchestration.graph_ir.NodeSpec`"
msgstr "权威实现：`relic.orchestration.graph_ir.NodeSpec`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:95
msgid "`class_type` is the node-definition key, registered Functor name, or importable class reference resolved by the execution layer."
msgstr "`class_type` 是 node-definition key、已注册的 Functor 名称，或由 execution layer 解析的可 import class reference。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:97
msgid "`inputs` describes literal values and upstream link bindings."
msgstr "`inputs` 描述 literal value 与 upstream link binding。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:98
msgid "`outputs` lists the variables or output ports declared by the node."
msgstr "`outputs` 列出 node 声明的 variable 或 output port。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:99
msgid "`config` is the node-local configuration passed to the resolved Functor. The executor also reads `execution_group` from this mapping; `validate_graph` rejects a value other than `fast`, `medium`, `slow`, or `None` in strict and non-strict mode, with the message `register_functor` raises (naming the node's `config.execution_group` as the source)."
msgstr "`config` 是传给已解析 Functor 的节点局部配置。执行器还从此映射中读取 `execution_group`；无论是否启用严格模式，`validate_graph` 都会拒绝 `fast`、`medium`、`slow`、`None` 以外的值，并使用 `register_functor` 抛出的错误消息（将节点的 `config.execution_group` 标为来源）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:105
msgid "`NodeSpec` is a declarative record. Port types and units come from `NodeDefinition` and `SSOTCatalog`, not from this class."
msgstr "`NodeSpec` 是 declarative record。Port type 与 unit 来自 `NodeDefinition` 和 `SSOTCatalog`，而不是此 class。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:108
msgid "`LinkEndpoint`"
msgstr "`LinkEndpoint`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:110
msgid "Canonical owner: `relic.orchestration.graph_ir.LinkEndpoint`"
msgstr "权威实现：`relic.orchestration.graph_ir.LinkEndpoint`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:118
msgid "`node` is a workflow-local node identifier."
msgstr "`node` 是 workflow-local node 标识符。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:119
msgid "`port` is the input or output port name on that node."
msgstr "`port` 是该 node 上的 input 或 output port 名称。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:121
msgid "`LinkEndpoint` is not re-exported by `relic.orchestration`. Direct construction therefore uses its canonical owner path."
msgstr "`LinkEndpoint` 未由 `relic.orchestration` 重新 export，因此直接构造时使用其 Canonical owner path。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:124
msgid "`LinkSpec`"
msgstr "`LinkSpec`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:126
msgid "Canonical owner: `relic.orchestration.graph_ir.LinkSpec`"
msgstr "权威实现：`relic.orchestration.graph_ir.LinkSpec`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:143
msgid "`source` identifies the producing node and output port."
msgstr "`source` 标识 producing node 与 output port。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:144
msgid "`target` identifies the consuming node and input port."
msgstr "`target` 标识 consuming node 与 input port。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:146
msgid "The dataclass does not check endpoint existence. `validate_graph()` performs that check against the complete graph."
msgstr "该 dataclass 不检查 endpoint 是否存在；`validate_graph()` 会针对完整 graph 执行该检查。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:149
msgid "Graph serialization"
msgstr "Graph 序列化"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:151
msgid "Canonical owner: `relic.orchestration.graph_io`"
msgstr "权威实现：`relic.orchestration.graph_io`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:153
msgid "Convenience imports:"
msgstr "便捷 import："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:159
msgid "`load_graph`"
msgstr "`load_graph`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:170
msgid "`path` selects a JSON, YAML, or YML graph document."
msgstr "`path` 选择 JSON、YAML 或 YML graph document。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:171
msgid "`validate_schema` enables JSON Schema validation before GraphIR parsing."
msgstr "`validate_schema` 在解析 GraphIR 前启用 JSON Schema validation。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:172
msgid "`schema_path` overrides the packaged `graph_schema.json`."
msgstr "`schema_path` 覆盖随包提供的 `graph_schema.json`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:174
msgid "Schema validation is also enabled when `RELIC_GRAPH_SCHEMA_VALIDATE` is set to a true value. Invalid JSON, YAML, schema content, or filesystem access raises the corresponding parser, `jsonschema`, or I/O exception. A decoded root that is not a mapping raises `ValueError`. Loading YAML without PyYAML raises `RuntimeError`."
msgstr "当 `RELIC_GRAPH_SCHEMA_VALIDATE` 设为 true value 时也会启用 schema validation。无效的 JSON、YAML、schema content 或 filesystem access 会引发相应 parser、`jsonschema` 或 I/O exception。解码后的 root 若不是 mapping 会引发 `ValueError`。缺少 PyYAML 时加载 YAML 会引发 `RuntimeError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:180
msgid "`save_graph`"
msgstr "`save_graph`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:186
msgid "The function writes the `GraphIR.to_dict()` representation as sorted, indented JSON. Filesystem errors propagate to the caller."
msgstr "该函数将 `GraphIR.to_dict()` representation 写为排序且缩进的 JSON。Filesystem error 会传播给 caller。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:189
msgid "Port and node contracts"
msgstr "Port 与 Node contract"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:191
msgid "`PortSpec`"
msgstr "`PortSpec`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:193
msgid "Canonical owner: `relic.orchestration.port_spec.PortSpec`"
msgstr "权威实现：`relic.orchestration.port_spec.PortSpec`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:238
msgid "Identity and physical-semantics parameters:"
msgstr "标识与物理语义参数："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:240
msgid "`name` is the local port or variable name."
msgstr "`name` 是 local port 或 variable name。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:241
msgid "`standard_name` is the canonical RELIC standard name."
msgstr "`standard_name` 是 canonical RELIC standard name。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:242
msgid "`units` is the UDUNITS-compatible unit string supplied by SSOT metadata."
msgstr "`units` 是由 SSOT metadata 提供的 UDUNITS-compatible unit string。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:243
msgid "`quantity` identifies the physical quantity category."
msgstr "`quantity` 标识 physical quantity category。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:244
msgid "`cf_standard_name` carries the CF-compatible standard name when declared."
msgstr "`cf_standard_name` 在声明时携带 CF-compatible standard name。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:245
msgid "`element` identifies a conserved element such as carbon, nitrogen, or water."
msgstr "`element` 标识 carbon、nitrogen 或 water 等 conserved element。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:247
msgid "Runtime and state-update parameters:"
msgstr "Runtime 与状态更新参数："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:249
msgid "`datatype` declares the runtime value category; the default is `tensor`."
msgstr "`datatype` 声明 runtime value category，默认值为 `tensor`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:250
msgid "`semantics` distinguishes meanings such as state, flux, tendency, or increment."
msgstr "`semantics` 区分 state、flux、tendency 或 increment 等含义。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:252
msgid "`update_mode` describes the requested update operation."
msgstr "`update_mode` 描述请求的 update operation。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:253
msgid "`write_mode` describes ownership or mutability semantics."
msgstr "`write_mode` 描述 ownership 或 mutability semantics。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:254
msgid "`required` marks a mandatory input or an optional output."
msgstr "`required` 标记 mandatory input 或 optional output。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:255
msgid "`context_requirements` declares conversion context keys required by the receiving port."
msgstr "`context_requirements` 声明 receiving port 所需的 conversion context key。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:257
msgid "`shape` carries declared dimensional or shape metadata."
msgstr "`shape` 携带已声明的 dimensional 或 shape metadata。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:258
msgid "`direction` declares input, output, or bidirectional use."
msgstr "`direction` 声明 input、output 或 bidirectional use。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:259
msgid "`per_timestep` marks a value whose interpretation is tied to a time step."
msgstr "`per_timestep` 标记其解释与 time step 绑定的 value。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:260
msgid "`conservative` identifies a port that participates in a conservation contract."
msgstr "`conservative` 标识参与 conservation contract 的 port。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:263
msgid "DEC and structural parameters:"
msgstr "DEC 与结构参数："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:265
msgid "`form_degree` is the discrete differential-form degree."
msgstr "`form_degree` 是 discrete differential-form degree。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:266
msgid "`primality` identifies primal or dual complex placement."
msgstr "`primality` 标识 primal 或 dual complex placement。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:267
msgid "`extensivity` identifies extensive or intensive interpretation."
msgstr "`extensivity` 标识 extensive 或 intensive interpretation。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:268
msgid "`complex_id` identifies the associated discrete complex."
msgstr "`complex_id` 标识关联的 discrete complex。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:269
msgid "`physical_domain` names the physical domain represented by the cochain."
msgstr "`physical_domain` 命名 cochain 表示的 physical domain。"

