#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:283
msgid "`area_basis` is `leaf_area`, `ground_area`, or `grid_area`. `support_aggregation` reads it as the area measure of its values and weights; the quantity basis is the SSOT `spatial_basis`."
