#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:293
msgid "A support value outside these vocabularies, or an unknown name in `declared_support_fields`, raises `ValueError`. `NodeRegistry` fills the support fields from the `support` mapping of the SSOT entry; a `support` value that is not a mapping raises `ValueError`."
msgstr "支撑域取值超出上述词汇表，或 `declared_support_fields` 含有未知名称时，会抛出 `ValueError`。`NodeRegistry` 从 SSOT 条目的 `support` 映射填充支撑域字段；`support` 不是映射时抛出 `ValueError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:306
msgid "`is_support_declared()` raises `ValueError` for a name that is not a support field. `missing_support_declarations()` returns the support fields without an explicit declaration."
msgstr "`is_support_declared()` 在名称不是支撑域字段时抛出 `ValueError`。`missing_support_declarations()` 返回未显式声明的支撑域字段。"

