#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:379
msgid "`spatial_basis` is the declared spatial representation (`intensive`, `cell_total`, `area_density`, or `categorical`), resolved by `resolve_spatial_basis` from the entry's `spatial_basis`, or else from a `variable_type` of `intensive` or `categorical`. It is `None` when the entry declares neither key; a `variable_type` of `extensive` without `spatial_basis`, an unknown value, or an inconsistent pair raises `ValueError`. `quantity` names the physical quantity."
msgstr "`spatial_basis` 是声明的空间表示（`intensive`、`cell_total`、`area_density` 或 `categorical`），由 `resolve_spatial_basis` 根据条目的 `spatial_basis` 解析；否则根据值为 `intensive` 或 `categorical` 的 `variable_type` 解析。条目未声明这两个键时取 `None`；`variable_type` 为 `extensive` 却未声明 `spatial_basis`、存在未知值或两者不一致时，抛出 `ValueError`。`quantity` 表示物理量名称。"

