#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:434
msgid "`get(name)` returns the entry of that variable name, which is the unique catalog key. Otherwise it follows an explicit alias, from the parameter table `coupling.external.variables.aliases` or from a variable-contract alias, and then falls back to `get_by_standard_name(name)` without a `cell_methods` qualifier; it returns `None` when nothing matches. `get_by_standard_name()` treats the CF identity, `standard_name` together with `cell_methods` (CF-1.8 section 7.3), as one key: a request without `cell_methods` selects only the entry that declares none, and `None` is returned when no entry holds the identity."
msgstr "`get(name)` 返回该变量名对应的条目，变量名是目录中的唯一键。否则会跟随参数表 `coupling.external.variables.aliases` 或变量契约中显式声明的别名，再尝试不带 `cell_methods` 限定项的 `get_by_standard_name(name)`；无匹配时返回 `None`。`get_by_standard_name()` 将由 `standard_name` 和 `cell_methods` 组成的 CF 标识（CF-1.8 第 7.3 节）视为一个键：未给出 `cell_methods` 的请求只选择未声明该项的条目；没有条目具有该标识时返回 `None`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:444
msgid "The catalog keeps no conflict list; every conflict raises `ValueError`:"
msgstr "目录不保存冲突列表；任何冲突都会抛出 `ValueError`："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:446
msgid "A second declaration of an existing variable name is merged when it agrees and raises when it contradicts in units (dimensionless spellings count as equal), semantics, CF standard name, update or write mode, spatial basis, quantity, element, datatype, context requirements, `standard_name`, or `cell_methods`."
msgstr "再次声明已有变量名时，若两次声明一致则合并；若单位（无量纲的不同写法视为相同）、语义、CF 标准名、更新或写入模式、空间基准、物理量、元素、数据类型、上下文要求、`standard_name` 或 `cell_methods` 存在矛盾，则报错。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:451
msgid "One CF identity belongs to exactly one variable; a second variable that declares it raises. This rule is owned by `relic.data.standards.cf_conventions.register_cf_identity_holder`."
msgstr "一个 CF 标识只能属于一个变量；第二个变量声明同一标识时会报错。此规则由 `relic.data.standards.cf_conventions.register_cf_identity_holder` 负责。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:454
msgid "An entry name that collides with an alias, an alias that names another existing variable or is claimed by two variables, an alias whose target is unknown, and an alias entry that is not a pair of non-empty names raise."
msgstr "条目名与别名冲突、别名指向另一个已有变量或被两个变量同时占用、别名目标未知，以及别名条目不是一对非空名称，均会报错。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:458
msgid "`from_parameter_manager()` reads `coupling.external.variables.variable_definitions` and `coupling.scales.defaults.variables`, both required, then merges the packaged variable contracts read through `load_contract_registry()`, comparing units and CF standard name, and finally registers the optional alias table. A contract alias that names a parameter-catalog entry merges that entry into the contract variable. The factory raises `RuntimeError` when no manager is available, `KeyError` when a required payload is missing, `TypeError` when a required payload or a present alias table is not a mapping, and `ValueError` when the contract registry reports conflicts."
msgstr "`from_parameter_manager()` 读取两个必需项 `coupling.external.variables.variable_definitions` 和 `coupling.scales.defaults.variables`，然后合并通过 `load_contract_registry()` 读取的随包变量契约，比较单位和 CF 标准名，最后注册可选别名表。如果契约别名指向参数目录条目，则将该条目合并到契约变量。没有可用管理器时工厂抛出 `RuntimeError`；缺失必需数据时抛出 `KeyError`；必需数据或已提供的别名表不是映射时抛出 `TypeError`；契约注册表报告冲突时抛出 `ValueError`。"

