#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:526
msgid "`register_functor_instance()` derives port names from `FunctorMetadata.input_variables` and `FunctorMetadata.output_variables`. A Functor without metadata raises `ValueError`. An input port is required exactly when the Functor's `get_required_inputs()` names it (the `FunctorBase` rule: declared inputs minus `optional_input_variables`); an object without that method raises `TypeError`, and a required name that is not a declared input raises `ValueError`. If an SSOT entry is unavailable, the registry can still build a partial port whose units and semantic fields are unset; graph validation determines whether that contract is acceptable."
msgstr "`register_functor_instance()` 从 `FunctorMetadata.input_variables` 和 `FunctorMetadata.output_variables` 得到端口名称。Functor 没有元数据时抛出 `ValueError`。仅当 Functor 的 `get_required_inputs()` 列出某输入端口时，该端口才是必需输入（`FunctorBase` 的规则：声明输入减去 `optional_input_variables`）；对象没有此方法时抛出 `TypeError`，必需名称未被声明为输入时抛出 `ValueError`。SSOT 条目不可用时，注册表仍可构建单位和语义字段未设定的部分端口；该契约是否可接受由图验证决定。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:536
msgid "`register_definition()` replaces an existing entry with the same key. `resolve_class_type()` first follows the dotted `runtime_class` in the metadata of a registered definition (a value that is not a dotted string raises `ValueError`; one that does not name a class raises `TypeError`), then handles `Functor:<module>.<Class>` references, and returns `None` for other formats. Module import failures propagate."
msgstr "`register_definition()` 替换同键的已有条目。`resolve_class_type()` 先跟随已注册定义元数据中采用点分路径的 `runtime_class`（不是点分字符串时抛出 `ValueError`；未指向类时抛出 `TypeError`），再处理 `Functor:<module>.<Class>` 引用，其他格式返回 `None`。模块导入错误会向上传播。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:545
msgid "`NodeRegistry` owns orchestration node definitions only. It does not replace the scientific Functor registry, `UnifiedParameterManager`, or `ValidationRegistry`."
msgstr "`NodeRegistry` 仅拥有 orchestration node definition。它不替代 scientific Functor registry、`UnifiedParameterManager` 或 `ValidationRegistry`。"

