msgstr "`context` 提供 time-step 或 area information 等所需的 conversion context。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:663
msgid "`strict` promotes optional semantic and structural mismatches to errors."
msgstr "`strict` 将 optional semantic 与 structural mismatch 提升为 error。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:665
msgid "The function checks datatype, quantity, element, CF standard name, units, state-update semantics, conversion context, DEC/IPHS structural fields, and explicit support declarations across `PORT_SUPPORT_FIELDS` (emitting `missing_port_support_metadata` when a support field is declared on only one endpoint, and `<field>_mismatch` when both endpoints declare differing values; promoted to blocking errors when `strict=True` and advisory warnings when `strict=False`). Ordinary incompatibilities are returned inside `ConnectionDecision` without raising exceptions. A convertible mismatch sets `requires_adapter=True`."
msgstr "该函数依次检查数据类型、物理量、元素、CF 标准名、单位、状态更新语义、换算上下文、DEC/IPHS 结构字段，以及跨 `PORT_SUPPORT_FIELDS` 的显式支撑域声明（仅单端声明支撑域字段时发出 `missing_port_support_metadata`，双端声明值不同时发出 `<field>_mismatch`；在 `strict=True` 时升级为阻断错误，在 `strict=False` 时作为提示警告）。常规不兼容项封装在 `ConnectionDecision` 中返回而不抛出异常；可通过适配器转换的差异会将 `requires_adapter=True` 置位。"

