msgstr "`kwargs[\"temporal_resampler\"]` 是可选的可调用对象，在窗口模式下应用于 `value`；与 `current_step` 组合使用时抛出 `ValueError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:821
msgid "Without a resampler, `kwargs[\"method\"]` must be `interval_mean` or `interval_integral`; otherwise `RuntimeError` is raised."
msgstr "没有重采样器时，`kwargs[\"method\"]` 必须是 `interval_mean` 或 `interval_integral`；否则抛出 `RuntimeError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:824
msgid "In window mode the built-in methods form the duration-weighted sum of the samples along `kwargs[\"axis\"]` (default `0`) with `kwargs[\"sample_durations\"]` (default one per sample): `interval_integral` returns that sum and `interval_mean` divides it by the total duration. The durations must be one-dimensional, match the axis length, be finite and non-negative, and have a positive sum; otherwise `ValueError` is raised. In `current_step` mode only `interval_mean` is allowed and no `axis` may be given; `sample_durations` must be a scalar equal to the runtime `kwargs[\"dt\"]`, and the value is returned unchanged as a zero-order hold over the step. A missing duration or `dt` in that mode raises `RuntimeError`. Errors raised by a provided resampler propagate."
msgstr "窗口模式下，内置方法沿 `kwargs[\"axis\"]`（默认 `0`），按 `kwargs[\"sample_durations\"]`（默认每个样本为 1）对样本作时长加权求和：`interval_integral` 返回该和，`interval_mean` 将其除以总时长。时长必须为一维、与轴长度一致、有限且非负，并且总和为正；否则抛出 `ValueError`。`current_step` 模式只允许 `interval_mean`，不能提供 `axis`；`sample_durations` 必须是与运行时 `kwargs[\"dt\"]` 相等的标量，数值原样返回，表示该步内的零阶保持。此模式缺失时长或 `dt` 时抛出 `RuntimeError`。用户重采样器抛出的错误会向上传播。"

