#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:1020
msgid "`unit_converter` overrides the canonical converter used by the built-in unit adapter and compatibility suggestions."
msgstr "`unit_converter` 覆盖 built-in unit adapter 和 compatibility suggestion 使用的 canonical converter。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:1044
msgid "The built-in adapter keys are `unit_cast` (`UnitCastAdapter`), `temporal_resample` (`TemporalResampleAdapter`), `semantic_adapter` and its synonym `flux_to_increment` (one shared `SemanticAdapter`), `area_basis_transform` (leaf-area and ground-area flux densities converted through the leaf area index), `surface_flux_to_volume_source` (an areal molar flux injected as a mass source into the lowest volume layer only), and `support_aggregation` (weighted aggregation to an explicit spatial support: the quantity basis is the SSOT `spatial_basis` of the port variable, carried by `NodeDefinition.metadata[\"support_quantity_basis\"]`; `ExecutableAdapterFunctor` supplies that basis, the bound PortSpecs and `coupling.scales.defaults.conservation_tolerance`, which configuration must not declare; the ledger is reported in `last_adapter_metadata`, and `enforce_conservation: true` makes a ledger residual raise when it exceeds both the relative tolerance times the source amount and the floating-point rounding bound of the reduction). `AdapterRegistry` registers six concrete adapter classes across seven keys: `unit_cast`, `temporal_resample`, `semantic_adapter`, `flux_to_increment` (shared `SemanticAdapter` instance), `area_basis_transform`, `surface_flux_to_volume_source`, and `support_aggregation`. `register_executable_node(...)` validates unit, shape, context-port, and SSOT `spatial_basis` contracts before registering an `ExecutableAdapterFunctor` definition in `NodeRegistry`. `get()` returns `None` for an unknown key. `suggest_unit_adapter()` returns `unit_cast` only when the declared units differ and the canonical converter reports a supported conversion."
msgstr "内置适配器键包括：`unit_cast`（`UnitCastAdapter`）、`temporal_resample`（`TemporalResampleAdapter`）、`semantic_adapter` 及其同义键 `flux_to_increment`（共用同一个 `SemanticAdapter`）、`area_basis_transform`（通过叶面积指数在叶面积基准与地表面积基准之间换算通量密度）、`surface_flux_to_volume_source`（将面积摩尔通量作为质量源仅注入最底部体积层），以及 `support_aggregation`（向显式空间支撑域执行加权聚合：量的表示基准取自端口变量的 SSOT `spatial_basis`，由 `NodeDefinition.metadata[\"support_quantity_basis\"]` 承载；`ExecutableAdapterFunctor` 负责提供该基准、已绑定的 PortSpec 与 `coupling.scales.defaults.conservation_tolerance`，配置不得自行声明这些项；收支账本通过 `last_adapter_metadata` 报告，启用 `enforce_conservation: true` 后，若收支残差同时超过相对容差乘以源端总量与归约运算的浮点舍入界，则直接抛出异常）。`AdapterRegistry` 在七个键上共注册六个具体适配器类：`unit_cast`、`temporal_resample`、`semantic_adapter`、`flux_to_increment`（共享 `SemanticAdapter` 实例）、`area_basis_transform`、`surface_flux_to_volume_source` 与 `support_aggregation`。`register_executable_node(...)` 在向 `NodeRegistry` 注册 `ExecutableAdapterFunctor` 定义前，会校验单位、形状、上下文端口与 SSOT `spatial_basis` 契约。对未知键调用 `get()` 返回 `None`；仅当声明单位不同且规范换算器支持该换算时，`suggest_unit_adapter()` 才返回 `unit_cast`。"

