#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:1216
msgid "`auto_adapt` records adapter insertions in `CompileReport` and applies triple-guard automatic lowering only when (1) `can_connect` selects a single unambiguous `unit_cast` without `multiple_adapters_required` (otherwise `ambiguous_adapter` or `unsupported_auto_adapter` is recorded), (2) `UnitConverter` executes the conversion with `context=None`, and (3) both endpoint nodes declare the same explicit `execution_group`. Qualifying edges are lowered into `ExecutableAdapterFunctor` nodes and revalidated; any other adapter requirement raises `ValueError`."
msgstr "`auto_adapt` 会在 `CompileReport` 中记录适配器插入项，且仅在以下三重守卫同时满足时执行节点下沉：(1) `can_connect` 选出唯一且无歧义的 `unit_cast`，未标记 `multiple_adapters_required`（否则记录 `ambiguous_adapter` 或 `unsupported_auto_adapter`）；(2) `UnitConverter` 可在 `context=None` 条件下直接执行换算；(3) 两端节点均显式声明相同的 `execution_group`。满足条件的边会下沉为 `ExecutableAdapterFunctor` 节点并重新执行图校验；其他任何适配器需求均抛出 `ValueError`。"

