msgid "Packaged contracts are read only through `load_contract_registry(contracts_dir: Optional[Path] = None) -> ContractRegistry` (`from relic.contracts import load_contract_registry, PACKAGED_CONTRACTS_DIR`). It loads one directory strictly, by default `PACKAGED_CONTRACTS_DIR`, and returns the same registry for that resolved directory for the rest of the process; a failed load is not cached. Its consumers, including StateManager, the transport bridge, `UnitSystem`, and `SSOTCatalog`, share that registry and treat it as read-only."
msgstr "随包契约只能通过 `load_contract_registry(contracts_dir: Optional[Path] = None) -> ContractRegistry`（`from relic.contracts import load_contract_registry, PACKAGED_CONTRACTS_DIR`）读取。它严格加载一个目录，默认为 `PACKAGED_CONTRACTS_DIR`；在当前进程余下时间内，为同一解析目录返回同一注册表，失败加载不缓存。StateManager、输运桥接类、`UnitSystem` 和 `SSOTCatalog` 等使用者共享该注册表，并将其视为只读。"

