#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:2242
msgid "`python -m relic.orchestration` (`relic.orchestration.__main__`) exposes `validate <graph>` and `compile <graph>` (`--strict`, `--auto-adapt`, `--output`) over `load_graph`, `validate_graph`, and `compile_graph`."
msgstr "`python -m relic.orchestration`（`relic.orchestration.__main__`）基于 `load_graph`、`validate_graph` 与 `compile_graph` 提供 `validate <graph>` 与 `compile <graph>`（支持 `--strict`、`--auto-adapt`、`--output`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:2245
msgid "`python -m relic.interfaces.cli.main` exposes seven top-level subcommands: `params`, `optimization` (`opt`, `[N]`), `data`, `compute`, `stochastic` (`stoch`), `orchestration` (`graph`), and `healthcheck` (`health`)."
msgstr "`python -m relic.interfaces.cli.main` 提供七个顶层子命令：`params`、`optimization`（`opt`，`[N]`）、`data`、`compute`、`stochastic`（`stoch`）、`orchestration`（`graph`）以及 `healthcheck`（`health`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:2248
msgid "Certified Level 2 (`[I]`) stochastic processes (`OrnsteinUhlenbeckTemperatureFunctor` and `MarkedPoissonRainfallFunctor`) compile and execute through `GraphIR` and `GraphExecutor` with `FunctorSubstreamMixin` checkpoint replay. By contrast, `optimization` CLI subcommands are `[N]` (`runtime_unbound`), and `FourDVar` in `relic.optimization.assimilation` is an unimplemented `[N]` framework shell without an adjoint model (`compute_gradient` raises `NotImplementedError`)."
msgstr "已认证的 Level 2（`[I]`）随机过程（`OrnsteinUhlenbeckTemperatureFunctor` 与 `MarkedPoissonRainfallFunctor`）可通过 `GraphIR` 与 `GraphExecutor` 编译和执行，并借助 `FunctorSubstreamMixin` 支持检查点确定性重放。相比之下，`optimization` 命令行子命令处于 `[N]`（`runtime_unbound`），`relic.optimization.assimilation` 中的 `FourDVar` 则是未实现的 `[N]` 框架外壳，不含伴随模型（调用 `compute_gradient` 会抛出 `NotImplementedError`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/orchestration_validation.md:2256
